{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p38493-819e2400b7080c3fb297","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"그르릉, 다시 만나서 정말 기쁘구나. 나의 사도여, 내 나침반은 이미 네 배낭 속의 디저트를 가리키고 있다!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18079298518522843296"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-5a23e94851fa251f539a","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"쓰읍… 이번엔 금 디저트일까 은 디저트일까…. 뭐 할 말 있으면 얼른 물어봐라냥","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8531233303017726754"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-e5f6dca2d5285a2a60da","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"야옹야옹 「개척」의 길에 대해…","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10846911564756393012","1983343015796010415"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-86c2cf9ab71dbd97f9a7","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"그날, 깊게 잠들어 있던 나는 어둠 속에서 {RUBY_B#무명객의 나침반}개척의 방향{RUBY_E#}을 찾았고, 그것이 인도하는 방향을 따라 {RUBY_B#상자}블랙홀{RUBY_E#}을 빠져나왔지——그렇게 해서, 이 야옹님이 디저트 형태로 부활했다는 말씀!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13739562975031068209"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-5604bf042424fb8f2e31","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"나처럼 차가운 우주를 {RUBY_B#유랑}「탐사」{RUBY_E#}하는 꼬마 녀석들이 아직 많아…. 그래서 이 야옹님은 녀석들을 위해 뭔가 해주고 싶어","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18065246377028098831","13227584631220123910"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-e836f2306c6b18f8f956","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"그들이 인간과 교류하는 능력을 「이해」하고 「수립」하도록 가르치고, {RUBY_B#꼬리를 맡길 수 있는}「연결」{RUBY_E#}된 가족을 찾아서 마지막엔 행복한 삶을 살게 해주는 것, 그게 내 바람의 전부야!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6650074558690140855","2571028377503240453"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-cac7b4b969d0bc605e96","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"하지만 녀석들이 귀여운 척… 아니, 열심히 노력하는 것만으로는 부족해! 너처럼 녀석들에게 집을 마련해 줄 사람이 더 많이 필요하다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4689663257955038815","7074387576357968846"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-25b5349dd8ec06716921","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"그래서 난 네가 {RUBY_B#녀석들을 입양할 사람}사도{RUBY_E#}가 되길 바라는 거다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11218552586261785734","6485056970292537349"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-ddc9116ff9c5f15ddb80","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"우리 집에 또 오는 것에 대해…","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["18204324620897476902"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-a37203e77a0495d87ac2","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"다시 올 거야, 난 「냥키비리」니까냥! 게다가, 은하열차는 내 영원한 집이니까……","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2583459319219565644"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-739f27951ca789e30d03","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"맞나… 맞겠지?","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5785855102426723807"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-559d07ba036e74163e73","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"냥! 난 네가 마음에 들어, 넌 정말 착한 사람이다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18083789222366620941"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-0b0816dd8a5560e6803a","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"캣타워에 대해…","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["956430559506882402"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-36a97522904007164fb5","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"야옹야옹, 에이언즈의 선물이야. 어디서 났는지는 묻지 마. 네 마음에 들면 그걸로 됐어!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18438686360324065797"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-e04704d48b461a0bab1c","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"나사가 풀리거나 접착제가 떨어지면 이 야옹님한테 말해 줘. 걱정 마, 에이언즈라도 A/S는 보장된다냥~","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14348997576512810419"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-7f8dacc3722283e77cc3","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"이 몸은 책임감 넘치는 천하무적 냥이라고!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12273098415015997099"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-a8ee42f377cf65055c5b","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"네 출신에 대해…","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2857291734213040749"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-6c20338a065c7742d15d","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"야옹, 출신? 이 야옹님이 이미 말했었잖아? 난 「아키비리」의 디저트 형태다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12258287401437027807"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-1a4e3619d9cc8b0ee1c7","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"사실 「개척」의 에이언즈인지가 무슨 상관이야? 냥~ 우린 모두 「개척」을 하고 있잖아","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13224928378915123607"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-b2bbd33378ae593cb425","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"이런 신분이 있으면 더 많은 사람들이 내 말에 귀를 기울여주고, 더 많은 녀석들의 보금자리를 찾아줄 수 있으니까…. 그래서 난 내가 「아키비리」라고 믿고 싶다냥","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16766664040809310949"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-0538e415f04ae88eb9b8","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"냥~ 이 일은 녀석들한테 비밀로 하자고!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12196670908106115876"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-80529a72a82bf3f6cf3c","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"지금 녀석들은 진심으로 믿고 있거든. 이 광활한 은하 어딘가에, 집을 찾게 인도해 줄 나침반이 돌아가고 있다고…. 그게 바로 이 야옹님이다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9243536937824140599"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-18789b4d0dae7ddcbe42","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","text":"냥~ 알현 끝. 이 야옹님은 오늘 여기서 잠시 쉬어야겠어","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 4","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5625673620613771114","2937835210065333607"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p38493","title":"「냥키비리」","page":"「阿基喵利」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p38493-819e2400b7080c3fb297","rowId":"other-npc-p38493-819e2400b7080c3fb297","missionId":"npc-p38493","mission":"「냥키비리」","sceneId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","scene":"NPC 대사 4","contextId":"wiki-context-c6d19a4da9ce87b79a431ca7","page":"「阿基喵利」","revision":103567,"location":[0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-npc-p38493-5a23e94851fa251f539a"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-5a23e94851fa251f539a","rowId":"other-npc-p38493-5a23e94851fa251f539a","missionId":"npc-p38493","mission":"「냥키비리」","sceneId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","scene":"NPC 대사 4","contextId":"wiki-context-c6d19a4da9ce87b79a431ca7","page":"「阿基喵利」","revision":103567,"location":[0,1],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-e5f6dca2d5285a2a60da","rowId":"other-npc-p38493-e5f6dca2d5285a2a60da","missionId":"npc-p38493","mission":"「냥키비리」","sceneId":"sa6d1269f90fb03f3","scene":"NPC 대사 4","contextId":"wiki-context-c6d19a4da9ce87b79a431ca7","page":"「阿基喵利」","revision":103567,"location":[0,2,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["75d2d3e7b878-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p38493-86c2cf9ab71dbd97f9a7"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-86c2cf9ab71dbd97f9a7","rowId":"other-npc-p38493-86c2cf9ab71dbd97f9a7","missionId":"npc-p38493","mission":"「냥키비리」","sceneId":"sa